## 4. What the rollback release note must contain

At minimum, filled in per incident, not left as boilerplate:

- What was wrong with the previous release
- What this release changes about it
- Who is affected, and whether any action is needed on their end
- A link to the incident record from §3

<!-- DECIDE: anything this project's release notes always need beyond the
